{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13066","headline":"送粲上人兼寄梁镇员外 · 郎士元","name":"送粲上人兼寄梁镇员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"季月还乡独未能，林行溪宿厌层冰。\n尺素欲传三署客，雪山愁送五天僧。\n连空朔气横秦苑，满目寒云隔灞陵。\n借问从来香积寺，何时携手更同登。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}